      "hook": "At E026-B0031 (0.0s), the Dowager Duchess directly challenges Juliana from her bed: 'Then tell me... why is a girl of such noble spirit working as a common maid?'",
      "cliffhanger": "Ends on E026-B0051 as the Duchess clamps both hands onto Juliana's hand, frantically demanding where she got the family signet ring before Juliana can answer.",
      "standalone_context": "The dialogue reveals Juliana is a cast-out noblewoman surviving in servant's attire whose distinctive ring sparks immediate recognition and shock in the ailing Duchess.",
      "why_it_works": "The clip smoothly builds from an intimate confession of exile to an electrifying heirloom discovery.",
