      "cliffhanger": "Ends on E027-B0095 as an armed guard twists Juliana around and drags her toward the cells while she stares in horror at the aristocrats framing her for attempted murder.",
      "standalone_context": "Juliana attempts to warn the family that someone is poisoning the Duchess, but the corrupt nobles deliberately invert her confession to accuse her of administering the poison.",
      "why_it_works": "A fast-paced confrontation turns an act of mercy into a terrifying legal trap in under forty-five seconds.",
