      "hook": "At E028-B0073 (0.8s in), Catherine looks up from the captured ledger with a malicious grin and declares: 'Lady Juliana Ashcroft.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Ends on E028-B0096 as Catherine waves the herbal ledger and promises to send Juliana to the gallows before the magistrate while guards drag Juliana into the corridor.",
      "standalone_context": "The antagonist exposes the captured maid as a fallen noblewoman married to a penniless veteran, sentencing her to the castle's wet cells under accusation of murder.",
      "why_it_works": "Condenses a dramatic identity unmasking, personal humiliation, and a sentence of death into a single relentless exchange.",
      "concerns": "None identified."
