      "hook": "At E030-B0031 (0.6s in), the Elder Nobleman paces behind his desk and coldly declares: 'We use the law to destroy her.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Ends on E030-B0049 as the Elder Nobleman gives the order: 'Do not hide the evidence, manufacture it. Drag her before the magistrate tomorrow, frame the trial, buy the jury, and let the State hang her.'",
      "standalone_context": "Three wealthy conspirators scheme in a private study to twist an imprisoned healer's herbal remedies into a capital charge of witchcraft so the legal system will execute her.",
